  {
   "start": 1.2,
   "end": 2.9,
   "text": "Jun wrote *rules*\nfor the new game.",
   "style": "Cap"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.8,
   "end": 6.5,
   "text": "*One*: never let your\ncharacter sleep.",
   "style": "Cap"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.5,
   "end": 11.7,
   "text": "*Two*: if the radio plays\na lullaby, save and quit.",
   "style": "Cap"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.5,
   "end": 15.5,
   "text": "*Three*: never pause\non a dark street.",
   "style": "Cap"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.0,
   "end": 17.8,
   "text": "*Four*...",
   "style": "Whisper"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.6,
   "end": 22.0,
   "text": "if your character lies down,\nclose *your own eyes* too.",
   "style": "Whisper"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.3,
   "end": 24.4,
   "text": "I asked him *why*.",
   "style": "Cap"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.4,
   "end": 27.4,
   "text": "So it doesn't\n*close them for you*.",
   "style": "Whisper"
  }
